      "title": "No Vacancy: Tight supply keeps Houston retail humming at mid-year",
      "source": "REJournals",
      "link": "https://rejournals.com/no-vacancy-tight-supply-keeps-houston-retail-humming-at-mid-year/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=no-vacancy-tight-supply-keeps-houston-retail-humming-at-mid-year",
